 Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/organisations/ministry-of-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"roles":[{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","base_path":"/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","content_id":"e4f33898-53fd-4329-94a7-796ae424ba5b","details":{"body":"<ul>\n  <li>Local government finance (including local taxation, business rates and local government pensions) </li>\n  <li>Local government policy (including stewardship, local audit, and governance reform) </li>\n  <li>Local government reorganisation </li>\n  <li>Homelessness and rough sleeping </li>\n  <li>Supported housing and domestic abuse </li>\n  <li>Resettlement </li>\n  <li>Planning casework</li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":100,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2025-09-15T09:36:24Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Minister of State (Minister for Local Government and Homelessness)","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/minister-of-state--201","withdrawn":false},{"api_path":"/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","base_path":"/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","content_id":"87779e9b-11a9-402a-9c4d-94dfa892f785","details":{"body":"<p>The Secretary of State has strategic oversight of the Department’s business and policy including: </p>\n\n<ul>\n  <li>Housing and planning </li>\n  <li>Local government and English devolution </li>\n  <li>Regional and local growth </li>\n  <li>Communities and faith </li>\n  <li>Democracy and elections</li>\n  <li>Building safety and remediation  </li>\n  <li>Public Appointments  </li>\n  <li>Planning casework </li>\n  <li>Corporate </li>\n</ul>\n","role_payment_type":null,"seniority":18,"whip_organisation":{}},"document_type":"ministerial_role","links":{},"locale":"en","public_updated_at":"2026-08-14T14:46:16Z","schema_name":"role","title":"Secretary of State for Housing, Communities and Local Government","web_url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/ministers/secretary-of-state-for-housing-communities-local-government","withdrawn":false}],"taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/regional-and-local-government/finance-capital-assets","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/regional-and-local-government/finance-capital-assets","base_path":"/regional-and-local-government/finance-capital-assets","content_id":"d7297215-a71a-4cd2-8e54-8405ed040901","details":{"internal_name":"Local government finance and capital assets [T]","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/regional-and-local-government/local-government","base_path":"/regional-and-local-government/local-government","content_id":"c914fd40-dd0a-45c4-a6ff-bce0cda31bde","details":{"internal_name":"Local government (merged, Level 2)","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":false},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"parent_taxons":[{"api_path":"/api/content/regional-and-local-government","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/regional-and-local-government","base_path":"/regional-and-local-government","content_id":"503c5bc7-809a-47b9-83e2-bd0c212dbabb","description":"","details":{"internal_name":"Regional and local government","notes_for_editors":"","visible_to_departmental_editors":true},"document_type":"taxon","links":{"root_taxon":[{"api_path":"/api/content/","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/","base_path":"/","content_id":"f3bbdec2-0e62-4520-a7fd-6ffd5d36e03a","document